Package: com.lmy.local-siri
Name: Local Siri (engine)
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.1)
Maintainer: tslmy
Author: tslmy
Homepage: https://github.com/tslmy/local-siri-on-ipod-touch-4
Description: Siri on iPod touch 4G, answered entirely on the device
 Speech recognition (Whistle) and a small language model (SmolLM2-135M),
 an ACE server and a tweak that make iOS 6 Siri talk to them instead of Apple.
 iPod touch 4G on iOS 6.1.x only.
 Siri's own files are Apple's and are NOT in this package: add them from
 your own iPhone 4S firmware download (see the project README).
